create any network.

00:13:48.920 --> 00:13:52.670
We call it default network
is pre-created for you.

00:13:52.670 --> 00:13:57.870
Inside the default network, we
create auto-mode subnetworks.

00:13:57.870 --> 00:14:00.770
We have two different modes
of subnetworks we create.

00:14:00.770 --> 00:14:06.380
But auto-mode, we pre-create
one subnetwork in every region.

00:14:06.380 --> 00:14:09.920
These are non-overlapping,
non-contiguous different

00:14:09.920 --> 00:14:11.510
ranges.

00:14:11.510 --> 00:14:13.380
We pick the addressing
range for you.

00:14:13.380 --> 00:14:16.960
You don't have to know what
is the addressing for you.

00:14:16.960 --> 00:14:19.350
Then you come along and
