00:14:19.350 --> 00:14:23.540
I don't want you to create
actually auto-mode subnetworks.

00:14:23.540 --> 00:14:26.090
I want to create many
such subnetworks.

00:14:26.090 --> 00:14:29.230
For example, you may say
that each of my service,

00:14:29.230 --> 00:14:30.750
I wanted a subnetwork.

00:14:30.750 --> 00:14:33.450
Maybe Google Play services,
