00:14:33.450 --> 00:14:34.900
You can do that.

00:14:34.900 --> 00:14:39.670
You can create up of hundreds
of subnetworks in a network.

00:14:39.670 --> 00:14:42.020
You can see in one
of the regions,

00:14:42.020 --> 00:14:43.020
